# Trivy ignore file — reviewed, time-boxed suppressions.
#
# Trivy (fs scan, HIGH/CRITICAL, exit-code 1) runs in CI security-scan
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml). It auto-reads this file from the repo root.
#
# No active suppressions. Each entry needs a CVE id, why it cannot be fixed
# here, its impact, and a revisit date.
#
# The brace-expansion suppressions (CVE-2026-13149, CVE-2026-14257,
# CVE-2026-69152) were removed when aws-cdk-lib moved to 2.273.0, whose bundled
# brace-expansion 5.0.12 is past every fix line.
